title: Decouple unbonding pool bound from bonding duration
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: The with_era map is now bounded by the fixed PostUnbondingPoolsWindow,
    and the merge cutoff uses an effective window of PostUnbondingPoolsWindow - bonding_duration.
    This prevents a lowered bonding duration from shrinking the bound and making stored
    state undecodable.
crates:
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
